@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userToken = 请粘贴微信用户登录返回的访问令牌
@adminToken = 请粘贴管理员登录返回的访问令牌
@employeeNo = YG0001
@employeeId = 1
@departmentId = 1
@userId = 1
@driverId = 1
@dispatchId = 1

### 1. 查询当前微信用户的员工身份
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/vehicle-employees/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 2. 员工自助绑定：必须先完成微信手机号授权，手机号须与员工档案一致
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/vehicle-employees/bind
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeNo": "{{employeeNo}}"
}

### 3. 已绑定且在职的员工提交内部用车申请
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/vehicle-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: vehicle-internal-{{$timestamp}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startAt": "2026-08-20T08:30:00",
  "endAt": "2026-08-20T17:30:00",
  "departure": "i某小程序集团办公楼",
  "destination": "示例景区",
  "passengerCount": 5,
  "estimatedKm": 60,
  "purpose": "景区运营现场协调"
}

> {% client.global.set("vehicleApplicationId", response.body.data.id); %}

### 4. 员工取消尚未审批的内部用车申请
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/vehicle-applications/{{vehicleApplicationId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 5. 管理员查询部门
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/vehicle-departments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. 管理员创建部门
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/vehicle-departments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "departmentCode": "WLJQ",
  "departmentName": "文旅景区运营部",
  "parentId": null,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 7. 管理员创建员工档案：姓名和手机号入库时自动加密
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/vehicle-employees
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeNo": "{{employeeNo}}",
  "name": "测试员工",
  "mobile": "13800000001",
  "departmentId": {{departmentId}},
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "userId": null
}

### 8. 管理员查询员工档案：敏感字段只返回脱敏值
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/vehicle-employees?status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 9. 管理员把员工档案绑定到微信用户
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/vehicle-employees/{{employeeId}}/account
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{userId}}
}

### 10. 管理员解绑员工微信账号
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/vehicle-employees/{{employeeId}}/account
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 11. 管理员把司机档案绑定到微信用户
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/vehicle-drivers/{{driverId}}/account
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{userId}}
}

### 12. 司机查询自己的身份
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/driver/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 13. 司机查询自己的全部任务：内部用车与社会租赁都从这里进入
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/driver/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 14. 司机接单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/driver/tasks/{{dispatchId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 15. 司机确认出发
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/driver/tasks/{{dispatchId}}/depart
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 16. 司机上报位置：微信坐标统一使用 GCJ02
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/driver/tasks/{{dispatchId}}/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "longitude": 109.84025,
  "latitude": 40.65741,
  "coordinateSystem": "GCJ02",
  "mileageKm": 12860.5,
  "eventAt": "2026-08-20T09:10:00",
  "remark": "已到达景区入口"
}

### 17. 司机完成任务：社会租赁任务会进入还车结算，不能绕过结算流程
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/driver/tasks/{{dispatchId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endMileageKm": 12920.5,
  "fuelLiter": 8.3,
  "remark": "已安全返回，车辆状况正常"
}

### 18. 管理员解绑司机微信账号：存在未完成任务时会拒绝解绑
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/vehicle-drivers/{{driverId}}/account
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
